DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Amsterdam:20260430T083000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Amsterdam:20260430T091500
SUMMARY:Registration & Welcome Coffee
DESCRIPTION:Pick up your badge\, grab a coffee\, and start networking with fellow Mac Admins
LOCATION:Leidse Schouwburg – Stadsgehoorzaal\, Breestraat 60\, 2311 CS Leiden\, Netherlands
URL:https://macadmins-eu.org/program
